  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 2,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "我们在上一课知道，固定 z 是在研究同一高度的集合；而现在我们要求对 x 的偏导数，则是固定输入变量 y，使其保持在常数值 y0。",
        "delivery": "neutral",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "intent": "强调固定 y=y0 是求对 x 偏导的前提",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "在曲面 z=x²+y² 上，我们引入垂直于 y 轴的截面 y=y0。在这个截面上，只有 x 在变化，高度 z 随之改变，而 y 则始终固定不变。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "point_at",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "reference": {
              "source": "reusable",
              "section": 1,
              "item": 1
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "注意，平移截面或者旋转视角只是帮我们观察不同的截线，平移本身并不是求导。我把截面位置 y0 从 0 平移到 1，请观察截线形态的变化。",
        "delivery": "careful",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "animate",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "number": 1,
            "end_value": 1,
            "duration_intent": "normal",
            "easing": "linear"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "当截面固定在 y=1 时，原曲面方程转化为一元函数 g(x) = x² + 1。",
        "delivery": "neutral",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "after_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "\\left.\\frac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\right|_{(x_0,1)} = \\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x}(x^2+1)"
            },
            "reusable_item": 1,
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "若取 x0=1，则对应空间中的点 P(1, 1, 2)。在二维截面图中，纵坐标表示高度 z，横坐标为 x。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "visual",
            "timing": "after_speech",
            "content": {
              "capability": "function_plot",
              "parameters": {
                "title": "截面 y=1 内的截线与切线（纵轴为高度 z）",
                "curve_labels": [
                  "截线 z=x²+1",
                  "P处切线 z=2x"
                ],
                "expressions": [
                  "((x)^(2))+(1)",
                  "(2)*(x)"
                ]
              }
            },
            "role": "supporting_visual",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "right_of",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 4,
                "item": 1
              }
            },
            "reusable_item": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "此时，截线方程为 z = x² + 1，它在点 (1,2) 处的切线方程为 z = 2x。偏导数的值正好就是该切线的斜率 2。",
        "delivery": "emphatic",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "intent": "展示截线与切线在 (1,2) 处相切的几何关系",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 1,
                "item": 1
              },
              {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 5,
                "item": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "student_activities": [
      {
        "kind": "number_target",
        "prompt": "请将截面位置 y0 调整回 1，观察截线在空间中的确切位置。",
        "hints": [
          "拖动滑块将 y0 设为 1"
        ],
        "success_message": "很好！此时截面固定在 y=1，对应截线方程为 z=x²+1。",
