  {
    "version": "0.1",
    "section": 3,
    "moments": [
      {
        "narration": "我们承接之前的概念：当研究同一高度时固定 z，而要求对 x 的偏导数时，则需要固定输入变量 y=y₀。",
        "delivery": "patient",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "f_x(x_0, y_0) = \\lim_{\\Delta x \\to 0} \\frac{f(x_0 + \\Delta x, y_0) - f(x_0, y_0)}{\\Delta x}"
            },
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 2,
                "item": 2
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "math",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "latex": "f_x(1,1) = \\left. \\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}x} (x^2 + 1) \\right|_{x=1} = 2"
            },
            "reusable_item": 1,
            "role": "derivation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 1,
                "item": 1
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "action": "focus",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "intent": "理解固定 y=y₀ 时曲面被截出沿 x 轴方向的截线",
            "references": [
              {
                "source": "reusable",
                "section": 2,
                "item": 2
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "设 g(x) = f(x, 1) = x² + 1，求导得 g'(x) = 2x，在 x=1 处导数值为 g'(1) = 2。利用点斜式得到切线方程 z - 2 = 2(x - 1)，即 z = 2x。",
        "delivery": "emphatic",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "create",
            "kind": "note",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "content": {
              "title": "截线求导与切线",
              "items": [
                "截线一元函数: g(x) = x² + 1",
                "导函数: g'(x) = 2x",
                "在 x=1 处的偏导数: f_x(1,1) = 2",
                "截面切线方程: z = 2x"
              ]
            },
            "role": "explanation",
            "placement": {
              "relation": "below",
              "reference": {
                "source": "local_board_item",
                "moment": 1,
                "item": 2
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "narration": "这里的斜率 2 代表高度增量与 x 增量的极限比值，而不是屏幕像素角度。一般地，f_x(x₀, y₀) = 2x₀。注意，本例在相同 x₀ 下斜率不依赖 y₀ 是 z=x²+y² 的特殊性质；若函数为 f(x,y)=xy，其偏导数 f_x=y 则直接依赖于 y 的取值。",
        "delivery": "careful",
        "actions": [
          {
            "action": "point_at",
            "timing": "during_speech",
            "reference": {
              "source": "reusable",
              "section": 2,
              "item": 2
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
